 'fail only when the selected uv is OLDER than the floor (version compare with `sort -V`)'","norm_id":"nc164853854616180","priority":0.198,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["A developer on macOS (default BSD sort, no coreutils) runs `make venv`: `sort -V` either errors with an unknown-option message or treats the flag input as a filename, so the floor comparison produces a wrong or failing result even when the host uv satisfies the floor."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Use a portable version comparison (e.g. a small awk/python one-liner or `printf '%s\\n' ... | sort -t. -k1,1n -k2,2n -k3,3n` equivalent) instead of `sort -V`, or state the coreutils/`gsort` prerequisite explicitly.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.75,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"none","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"self_revealing","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"low"}}}],"impact_model_version":"plan-v5","material_fingerprint":"7b15b4efd2cabe70","material_parts":{"children":["647ea2107ca5072f",0],"description":["d2278ebf14fc42d0",4630],"description_boxes":["399141be1d30ac26",0],"file_impact":["3e5a522283361d3f",8],"ticket_id":["c2a22323d9772d98",19]},"metrics":{"cache_read_tokens":812558,"cache_write_tokens